OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour exercise to simulate boat
OL,4,Afire and rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being advised not to be
OL,7,Falarmed ahead of a "realistic" boat
OL,8,Ffire training exercise in Weymouth
OL,9,FHarbour.
OL,11,FEmergency services are set to take part
OL,12,Fin the exercise in North Quay Marina
OL,13,Ffrom about 18:00 BST.
OL,15,FPeople can expect to see firefighters,
OL,16,Fharbour patrol vessels around the
OL,17,Fmarina and simulated smoke from a
OL,18,Fvessel on Alpha Pontoon.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
