OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour exercise to simulate boat
OL,4,Afire and rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeymouth Harbour said no live fire
OL,7,Fwould be used, and temporary access
OL,8,Frestrictions would be in place around
OL,9,Fthe area during the exercise, which is
OL,10,Fexpected to last for about two hours.
